      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "Our primary outcomes were allcause mortality; vaccine efficacy defined by either preventing COVID-19 symptoms plus positive polymerase chain rection (PCR) test, preventing severe COVID-19 symptoms plus positive PCR test, or preventing positive PCR test only; and serious adverse events [10].",
